oring!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/1e2e01655ab71d05dcf9fb1427d92008.poster.avif?t=1645208190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/1e2e01655ab71d05dcf9fb1427d92008.webm?t=1645208190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/1e2e01655ab71d05dcf9fb1427d92008.mp4?t=1645208190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be the fastest!</h2>Can you beat the stopwatch? Running to the finish line in a decent time is a challenge; only the bravest Lightbringers are capable of it.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/ad2583583a61f4e58b16a5528743faee.poster.avif?t=1645208190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/ad2583583a61f4e58b16a5528743faee.webm?t=1645208190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/ad2583583a61f4e58b16a5528743faee.mp4?t=1645208190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>What are you still waiting for? There is still so much darkness left to uncover!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581310/extras/076112cda660fb5ca44e69a87ae834af.avif?t=1645208190\" /></div> ",
